{"id":"en_knock-knock-boss-you-knocked-me-up","title":"Knock Knock Boss, You Knocked Me Up","titleEn":"Knock Knock Boss, You Knocked Me Up","description":"Sophie works as a secretary at a law firm, where a drunken encounter with her boss, Attorney Alexander, happens by mistake. In Alexander's recollection, however, that night becomes entangled with Olivia. Fearing dismissal, Sophie chooses to keep the incident hidden. Meanwhile, Alexander notices himself developing feelings for Sophie without any clear explanation. The story follows this awkward office situation and the gradual shift in Alexander's emotions as the secret lingers between them. For those interested, the series can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/knock-knock-boss-you-knocked-me-up/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/knock-knock-boss-you-knocked-me-up/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtoh0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_knock-knock-boss-you-knocked-me-up_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtoh0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_knock-knock-boss-you-knocked-me-up_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtoh0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_knock-knock-boss-you-knocked-me-up_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtoh0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_knock-knock-boss-you-knocked-me-up_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id"